---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Weekly Thing
description: A weekly collection of interesting links, ideas, and observations from across the internet, curated by Jamie Thingelstad.
permalink: /
---
{% set latestIssues = collections.issuesByDate %}
{% set latest = latestIssues[0] %}

{# ── Hero ── #}
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="home-hero-grid">
      <div class="home-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Issue #{{ latest.data.number }} · Weekend reading since 2017</p>
        <h1 class="home-hero-title">A weekend letter<br>about <em>what I&rsquo;m</em><br><em>learning.</em></h1>
        <p class="home-hero-tagline">I&rsquo;m Jamie. Every weekend I send out the things I read and thought about during the week &mdash; technology, the indie web, vinyl, family, whatever&rsquo;s caught my attention. It&rsquo;s not a product. It&rsquo;s a letter. I&rsquo;d love it if you read along.</p>
        <div class="home-hero-subscribe">
          {% set subscribeId = "hero" %}
          {% include "partials/subscribe-form.njk" %}
        </div>
        <p class="home-hero-proof">Free, every weekend &middot; No tracking, no ads &middot; Unsubscribe anytime</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="home-hero-side">
        <a href="/archive/{{ latest.data.number }}/" class="home-stamp">
          <span class="home-stamp-issue">#{{ latest.data.number }}</span>
          <span class="home-stamp-date">{{ latest.data.publish_date | dateShort }}</span>
          <hr>
          <p class="home-stamp-subject">{{ latest.data.subject }}</p>
          {% if latest.data.description %}
          <p class="home-stamp-desc">{{ latest.data.description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          <span class="home-stamp-cta">Read this issue &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Numbers strip ── #}
<section class="home-numbers">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="home-numbers-grid">
      <div class="home-num">
        <div class="home-num-value">{{ archiveStats.totalLinks | numberFormat }}</div>
        <div class="home-num-label">links shared</div>
        <div class="home-num-detail">across {{ latest.data.number }} issues</div>
      </div>
      <div class="home-num">
        <div class="home-num-value">{{ archiveStats.totalWords | numberFormat }}</div>
        <div class="home-num-label">words written</div>
        <div class="home-num-detail">notes &amp; commentary</div>
      </div>
      <div class="home-num">
        <div class="home-num-value">{{ archiveStats.uniqueDomainsTotal | numberFormat }}</div>
        <div class="home-num-label">sources read</div>
        <div class="home-num-detail">all over the web</div>
      </div>
      <div class="home-num">
        <div class="home-num-value">{{ archiveStats.yearsActive }}</div>
        <div class="home-num-label">years running</div>
        <div class="home-num-detail">unbroken since May 2017</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── What this is + a typical week ── #}
<section class="home-prop">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="home-prop-grid">
      <div class="home-prop-main">
        <p class="eyebrow">What this is</p>
        <h2>A letter, not a product. <em>Sharing what I&rsquo;m learning &mdash; nothing more.</em></h2>
        <p>I&rsquo;m not chasing growth. I&rsquo;m not selling anything. The Weekly Thing is just a way to share what I read, what I&rsquo;m working on, and what I&rsquo;m puzzling over &mdash; with people who want to read along.</p>
        <p>Range is the point. A single issue might cover agentic engineering, a cheeseburger review, an Ethereum deep dive, and family photos from Duluth. If something caught my attention, I&rsquo;ll tell you why. That&rsquo;s the whole pitch.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="home-prop-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">A typical week</p>
        <ul class="home-prop-list">
          <li><span class="home-prop-tag">Featured</span> One link worth your full attention</li>
          <li><span class="home-prop-tag">Notable</span> 4&ndash;6 stories with commentary</li>
          <li><span class="home-prop-tag">Briefly</span> A dozen quick mentions</li>
          <li><span class="home-prop-tag">Journal</span> Field notes, photos, small moments</li>
          <li><span class="home-prop-tag">Haiku</span> A small one to leave you with</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Readers ── #}
<section class="home-readers">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <p class="eyebrow">From readers</p>
    <h2 class="home-h2">It&rsquo;s the kind of letter you actually <em>read</em>.</h2>

    <div class="home-readers-stats">
      <div><strong>{{ survey.stats.recommendationScore.value }}%</strong><span>{{ survey.stats.recommendationScore.label }}</span></div>
      <div><strong>{{ survey.stats.readWholeIssue.value }}%</strong><span>{{ survey.stats.readWholeIssue.label }}</span></div>
      <div><strong>{{ survey.stats.longTimeReaders.value }}%</strong><span>{{ survey.stats.longTimeReaders.label }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-readers-quotes">
      {% for quote in quotes %}{% if quote.featured %}
      <blockquote class="home-q">
        <p>&ldquo;{{ quote.text }}&rdquo;</p>
      </blockquote>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="home-feelings">
      <p class="eyebrow">Readers say it makes them feel</p>
      <div class="home-feelings-cloud">
        {%- for word in survey.feelingWords %}
        <span class="f{{ word.frequency }}">{{ word.word }}</span>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Mid-page subscribe CTA ── #}
<section class="home-inline-cta">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <p class="home-inline-cta-text">{{ copy.ctas.mid1.headline or "Read along, every weekend." }}</p>
    {% set subscribeId = "mid1" %}
    {% include "partials/subscribe-form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ── About ── #}
<section class="home-about">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="home-about-grid">
      <img src="/img/jamie-thingelstad.jpg" alt="Jamie Thingelstad" class="home-about-photo" loading="lazy" width="200" height="200">
      <div>
        <p class="home-about-greeting">Hi, I&rsquo;m Jamie.</p>
        <h2 class="home-h2">Writing this from Minneapolis.</h2>
        <p>I&rsquo;m a CTO by day at <a href="https://www.spscommerce.com">SPS Commerce</a>, but this letter isn&rsquo;t about my day job. It&rsquo;s about the rest of it &mdash; the reading, the tinkering, the workshop projects, the family hikes, and the Wikipedia rabbit holes I keep falling into.</p>
        <p>I&rsquo;ve been writing the Weekly Thing every weekend since 2017. If any of that sounds like your kind of thing, I&rsquo;d love to have you along.</p>
        <p><a href="/about/">More about me &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── How it sounds: actual quotes from issues ── #}
{% if voiceSamples and voiceSamples.length > 0 %}
<section class="home-voice">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it sounds</p>
    <h2 class="home-h2">Pulled <em>verbatim</em> from real issues.</h2>
    <div class="home-voice-grid">
      {% for sample in voiceSamples | slice(0, 3) %}
      <blockquote class="home-voice-card">
        <p>&ldquo;{{ sample.text }}&rdquo;</p>
        <footer><a href="/archive/{{ sample.issueNumber }}/">{{ sample.issueTitle }}</a></footer>
      </blockquote>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{# ── Membership ── #}
<section class="home-membership">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <p class="eyebrow">Supporting Membership</p>
    <h2 class="home-h2">Free for everyone. <em>Members fund a nonprofit.</em></h2>
    <p>The Weekly Thing is free for everyone, always. Members contribute to a nonprofit selected each year &mdash; <strong>100% of fees are donated</strong>.</p>
    {% if support.current %}
    <p>This year, supporting <strong><a href="{{ support.current.url }}">{{ support.current.nonprofit }}</a></strong>.{% if stats.amount_raised > 0 %} ${{ stats.amount_raised | round }} raised so far.{% endif %}{% if stats.premium_subscriber_count > 0 %} {{ stats.premium_subscriber_count }} members.{% endif %}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p><a href="/members/" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn more &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Final CTA ── #}
<section class="home-cta">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <h2 class="home-cta-title">Read along this weekend.</h2>
    <p>Free, every weekend. No tracking, no ads. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    <div class="home-cta-form">
      {% set subscribeId = "footer" %}
      {% include "partials/subscribe-form.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
